DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_4C6A_B2BD';
<p>4c6a_b2bd</p> <h4>Two-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a two-point test cross examines two (2) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard two-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for both genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for both genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for two genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #894d00;">Gene E</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #894d00;"><i>eery</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #894d00;">Gene E</span> appears to have something off, crooked limbs and other twisted appendages.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #7242a5;">Gene F</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #7242a5;"><i>fuzzy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #7242a5;">Gene F</span> is covered in a dense layer of hairs, giving it a soft appearance.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="2" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery, fuzzy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe6c9; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f9e1ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">f</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">335</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe6c9; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7242a5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,954</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">fuzzy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #894d00;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f9e1ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">f</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,986</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #894d00;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7242a5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">325</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="3" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">6,600</span></td></tr></table><p>The phenotype counts resulting from the cross are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>Using the data presented in the table to determine the configuration of the alleles on the parental chromosomes. Determine whether the alleles for the two genes are in a <strong><i>cis</i></strong> (on the same chromosome) or <strong><i>trans</i></strong> (on different chromosomes) configuration.</p>
PROMPT_4C6A_B2BD
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_4C6A_B2BD_CHOICE_1';
cis
LITERAL_4C6A_B2BD_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_4C6A_B2BD_CHOICE_2';
trans
LITERAL_4C6A_B2BD_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_4C6A_B2BD_CHOICE_3';
both
LITERAL_4C6A_B2BD_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_4C6A_B2BD_CHOICE_4';
neither
LITERAL_4C6A_B2BD_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_4C6A_B2BD_CHOICE_5';
cannot be determined
LITERAL_4C6A_B2BD_CHOICE_5
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_4C6A_B2BD_CORRECT_1';
trans
LITERAL_4C6A_B2BD_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
